@prop q.meter_card
from: 4
name: The biscuit tin
place: q4w_saro_flat
mark: tin
macro: 2.4 2.6
tells: household e4_saro
carries: touch
touch: turn "Push the torch's switch" | It won't move. It was pushed on the night the lights went off on the Row and the battery went to rust in it with the switch on, and it has stayed on ever since. {sense: e4.torch.stuck}
state: 4 torch | A biscuit tin on the sideboard, buttons and string and a child's red torch with a dent in it. The torch's switch is pushed forward, on. The glass is dark.

