from: 4
name: The stencil in the bag
place: q4_police
mark: stencil
macro: 2.4 2.6
tells: era
carries: smell
touch: hold "Hold the stencil" | The card is stiff with paint, and through the bag it still smells of it, fresh. A kitchen knife cut it, and not well: the goat's legs are ragged where the blade slipped.
